# Normalize line endings across every OS.
#
# `text=auto` lets git decide which files are text (binaries are left alone),
# and `eol=lf` forces those text files to check out with LF everywhere —
# including Windows. This ends the CRLF/LF churn that made files show as
# "modified" and blocked `git pull` / `git checkout`.
* text=auto eol=lf
